I... can't move.

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:09.240
Hey...

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.620
This might be bad.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:13.080
Ai...

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:18.620
...good luck.

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:20.240
No way...

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:21.870
Rika!

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:23.330
Rika?!

00:22:57.080 --> 00:23:02.060
Next time

00:22:58.540 --> 00:22:59.830
To be continued!
